{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"bodyItems-wrapper\">    科技｜Google構建合成網絡 向自家AI瀏覽代理發動攻擊測試           <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left tight-spacing neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">Google旗下Chrome的AI安全團隊構建名為「Mirror Dimension」的合成網絡，內含數百個模擬社交平台、商店及銀行儀表板等網站，用以向自家AI瀏覽代理發動攻擊，進行安全測試。系統透過自訂HTTP標頭及本地代理等方式隱藏測試痕跡，令代理難以分辨網站真偽。Google稱每日可產生超過1000個攻擊測試候選，速度較人手快30倍以上，但未公布通過率，暫無數據顯示代理實際抵禦攻擊的能力。  </p> </div> </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T10:44:00.895681+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":231,"images":0,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T09:30:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T10:37:30.197210+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T10:37:30.197210+00:00","content_hash":"5fac509c043ce95f34cff182ecaf61fd4a528889b286b24159c23153b2642363","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}